{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國軍方聯合參謀本部11月4日表示，朝鮮向東部海域發射不明物體，目前未有更多細節</p><figure><img alt=\"朝中社於2026年10月15日發布圖片，顯示朝鮮於10月14日試射了兩種潛射戰略巡航導彈。（KCNA via REUTERS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187291570408263680260531.jpeg/jyiTFiPXXTBE5AZwqqSch2SAf-pv60oKGKz93his_d4\"/><figcaption>朝中社於2026年10月15日發布圖片，顯示朝鮮於10月14日試射了兩種潛射戰略巡航導彈。（KCNA via REUTERS）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T02:04:59.475214+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T00:55:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:38:54.494510+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T01:58:43.438306+00:00","content_hash":"c9515e8fb812864e773545246a1f5af14690394eb16f3a9a2f86f1dfda6f0313","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}